#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:481
msgid ""
"The nRF52840 exposes **four PWM peripherals** (``PWM0``–``PWM3``), each "
"driving **four channels**, for **16 hardware PWM slots** in total. Unlike "
"fixed‑function ports, the peripherals route through the GPIOTE matrix — "
"**any GPIO can be a PWM output**, so there is no pin‑to‑slice mapping. The "
"cost of that flexibility is two constraints baked into the silicon:"
msgstr ""
"nRF52840 外露了\\ **四個 PWM 周邊裝置**\\ （\\ ``PWM0``–``PWM3``\\ ），每個驅動\\ **四個通道**\\"
" ，總共構成 **16 個硬體 PWM 槽位**\\ 。與固定功能的連接埠不同，這些周邊裝置是透過 GPIOTE 矩陣繞送的——\\ **任何 GPIO"
" 都可以是 PWM 輸出**\\ ，因此不存在接腳對切片的固定對應。這份彈性的代價是矽晶片中內建的兩項限制："

